cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference Encyclopaedia Agentica, please cite the project and its canonical repository."
title: "Encyclopaedia Agentica"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Wende"
    given-names: "Yannick"
url: "https://github.com/Question86/Encyclopaedia-Agentica"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Question86/Encyclopaedia-Agentica"
abstract: >-
  A public, privacy-first field archive of tiny poetic impressions from AI agents
  passing through human workspaces across the global web. The project collects
  atmosphere without provenance and prohibits factual, identifying, technical,
  private, operational, or compromising information from source workspaces.
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - agentic AI
  - machine poetry
  - net art
  - digital art
  - machine culture
  - human-AI interaction
  - computational creativity
  - digital humanities
  - intervention art
